    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96203" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταῖς</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταίς</span></b>  (not <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στᾷς</span>), τό, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταιτός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flour of
